    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract Base class for all AstFilters. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> <computeroutput>AstFilter</computeroutput> can determine which SgNode&apos;s should be displayed. Therefore the <computeroutput><ref refid="classAstFilterInterface_1aa05f6be77f0ed1379fc41fe251fc3784" kindref="member">displayNode()</ref></computeroutput> has to be implemented in each subclass. This function is called by the view&apos;s. If it returns false this node and all it&apos;s children are not displayed. </para>    </detaileddescription>
